; The MAIN journal of the plan 28 Phase 6 hledger parity suite
; (crates/ledgeline-core/tests/projection_files.rs, the `parity_*` tests).
;
; Every account and commodity is declared, so `hledger check --strict` can run
; over this file plus any scenario beside it. `equity:unrealized gains` is
; deliberately NOT declared: the growth scenario's writer must declare it in
; the scenario file (plan 28 Decision 4).
;
; The latest real transaction is 2026-10-05. With "today" 2026-10-20 the
; monthly cutoff is 2026-10-01, so the October transaction below is a real
; transaction AFTER the cutoff: both Ledgeline and hledger's
; `expr:"NOT (date:CUTOFF.. AND NOT tag:generated)"` must leave it out.
;
; EUR is repriced inside the lookback (2026-09-15), so market valuation at
; each column's end is exercised against hledger's `--value=end,$`.

commodity $1,000.00
commodity 1,000.00 EUR
commodity 1,000.0000 AAPL

account assets:checking            ; type: C
account assets:savings             ; type: C
account assets:wise:eur            ; type: C
account assets:brokerage           ; type: A
account assets:house               ; type: A
account liabilities:card           ; type: L
account liabilities:payable        ; type: L
account equity:opening             ; type: E
account equity:preferred           ; type: E
account revenues:salary            ; type: R
account revenues:bonus             ; type: R
account expenses:rent              ; type: X
account expenses:food              ; type: X
account expenses:insurance         ; type: X
account expenses:travel            ; type: X
account expenses:legal             ; type: X
account expenses:payroll           ; type: X
account expenses:consulting        ; type: X

P 2026-01-01 EUR $1.10
P 2026-01-01 AAPL $100.00

